  aciklama:
  - "Orta s\u0131ralardaki fal g\xF6rsellerinde g\xF6z\xFCme tak\u0131lan \"D\xFCnya\"
    g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCs\xFC olduk\xE7a s\u0131rad\u0131\u015F\u0131 {{isim}}. \U0001F30D
    Telvelerindeki D\xFCnya imgesi sabit y\xF6r\xFCngesinde her zamanki rotas\u0131n\u0131
    \xE7izerken, birden sapmalara u\u011Fram\u0131\u015F. \xC7ekirde\u011Finde meydana
    gelen \"\u0131s\u0131 ve yo\u011Funluk\" fark\u0131 uzay\u0131n derinliklerinden
    gelmekte olan meteorlar\u0131 D\xFCnya'n\u0131n manyetik alan\u0131na sokmu\u015F.
    \U0001F320 Ho\u015Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n {{data, cinsiyet=erkek, han\u0131mefendinin
    | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, beyefendinin | cinsiyet=lgbt, insan\u0131n}} umulmad\u0131k
    bir \u015Fekilde sana \"\u0131s\u0131naca\u011F\u0131n\u0131\" ve duygular\u0131n\u0131n
    \"yo\u011Funla\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131\" d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorum. Sonras\u0131nda
    ise fal\u0131n, d\xFCnyas\u0131na beklenmedik bir giri\u015F yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor. A\xE7\u0131k\xE7a s\xF6ylemek gerekirse, bunun ger\xE7ekle\u015Febilmesi
    ad\u0131na evrensel g\xFC\xE7lerin harekete ge\xE7ti\u011Fini f\u0131s\u0131ld\u0131yor
    {{isim}} telvelerin.\n\nHo\u015Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n ki\u015Finin akl\u0131na
    ans\u0131z\u0131n girip d\xFCnyas\u0131n\u0131 sarsacak olman, kaderlerinizin
    adeta nak\u0131\u015F nak\u0131\u015F \"birlikte\" i\u015Flendi\u011Finin g\xF6stergesi.
    Aran\u0131zdaki fiziksel ve manevi mesafelerin a\u015F\u0131laca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm {{ay_2}} ay\u0131nda, {{kelime, sosyal medya \xFCzerinden
    yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131z bir konu\u015Fman\u0131n aniden farkl\u0131 bir boyut
    kazanaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorum. | ho\u015Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n ki\u015Finin
    senin hakk\u0131nda \xE7evreden alaca\u011F\u0131 baz\u0131 duyumlar neticesinde,
    sana olan ilgisinin artaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorum. | telefonuna b\u0131rakaca\u011F\u0131n
    bir \"cevaps\u0131z arama\" sonras\u0131 sana d\xF6n\xFC\u015F yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    ve koyu bir muhabbete dalaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 hissediyorum.}}"
